.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading and cooking systems.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person rolling, bullet catching, kicking, hookshot-hat, cannibalism, drinking booze and puking.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437570/extras/5417826755a9af7d22a6d1441027d853.poster.avif?t=1768548789\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437570/extras/5417826755a9af7d22a6d1441027d853.webm?t=1768548789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437570/extras/5417826755a9af7d22a6d1441027d853.mp4?t=1768548789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Count to six","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2437570/934fcd1f7a80b549ac6f532b865a2d05df6f496d.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2437570/43ce6787247f15dbd32101bc7fd2aa124b98fbe0.jpg"},{"name":"Only one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2437570/299c93364781c2e30b49ff80827f9fb324076d3b.jpg"},{"name":"Only one pack left","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2437570/42d1a3f0783d9dbf77c22ac14f86b30b04e42640.jpg"},{"name":"Booze Frenzy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2437570/77292a7ac1dbb983c6334164bb3b9396c40931e6.jpg"},{"name":"Falling out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2437570/94f963f05b96febd7794212a4f37175b92fbe344.jpg"},{"name":"So sleepy...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub